xsnip (3.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Manual pages in three languages: the English xsnip.1 is now the main page,
    the Russian one moved to man/ru and a Chinese translation was added in
    man/zh_CN; make install puts them into /usr/share/man/{,ru,zh_CN}/man1.
